ted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- v4.5.dev3.official [28089c40c]\n- master [1b4ed4c03]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev3 - Nobara Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using EXR textures (both 16f and 32f) as a normal map, various artifacts appear normally and when mipmaps and anisotropic filtering are used.\nThe mesh has tangents exported from Blender but auto-generated tangents do not make a difference.\n\n| PNG Texture, No Mipmaps | No Mipmaps   |Mipmaps (Linear)   |Mipmaps (Anisotropic)   |\n|--- |---|---|---|\n| ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b58b191f-45e6-4cb7-b9f0-97da02fa6bf3) |![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6b71693-d2f5-4353-b118-2cefd2ac648d) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/378e9f40-c5ae-45a6-a64b-5876c1dbd7e7) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8e38857-f12c-498e-bf2b-657dcc996455) |\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the MRP\n2. Observe artifacts with the default configuration (EXR normal map, Linear Mipmap filtering)\n3. Change the filtering modes on the material of the model to observe the different artifacts.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19940695/exr_normal_maps.zip)\nNote that the EXR file was created using Substance Painter 2024 in the 16f format.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/R